  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Version: 2019.1.4\n\nDescription: When using some avatars, usually tall ones, accessing any submenu in the ESC menu on Desktop mode breaks the up/down looking for that avatar. Instead of rotating the head, it seems to rotate the whole body from around the hip, creating a broken crouch effect. This is temporarily fixed only by switching avatars twice using avatars that don't regularly have this issue.\n\nHere is a short video showing how to reproduce this issue: https://youtu.be/d9pgTWODg2g\n\nThis seems to regularly happen with avatars over ~9ft in height. If necessary, I can provide the files for at least one avatar that has this issue consistently.\n\nEdit: this bug has been present for every version of VRchat for at least a year, and continues to be present in updated versions.",
